abstract: >
  QVP GLOBAL SYSTEM™ is an institutional-grade computational
  governance and sovereign capability evaluation framework
  integrating explainable artificial intelligence, probabilistic
  policy intelligence, governance analytics, resilience
  assessment, post-quantum cybersecurity evaluation,
  reproducible benchmarking methodologies, and sovereign
  decision intelligence through the Quantum-Veil Sovereignty
  Security Index (QSSI™) under the FAIR+D Canon™ Global
  Framework.

